%N A399234 Number of ways to build a contiguous building with n L-shaped LEGO blocks of size 2 X 2 up to rotations.
%C A399234 Seen from above the pieces have the following shape:
%C A399234   #
%C A399234   ##
%C A399234 which can be rotated:
%C A399234   #   ##  ##   #
%C A399234   ##  #    #  ##
%C A399234 and then used to make buildings.
%C A399234 Buildings are a set of LEGO bricks that are connected to each other by at least 1 stud.
%C A399234 Buildings are counted as identical with respect to translation and rotation around the vertical. Up-down symmetry is counted distinct due to the studs of the LEGO bricks.
%C A399234 The internal structure matters and the solid is not considered as a single solid.
